sequenceDiagram
    participant Agent as AI Agent
    participant TM as QuestradeTokenManager.py
    participant KC as macOS Keychain
    participant Cache as .questrade_cache
    participant QAuth as Questrade OAuth2 API

    Note over Agent, Cache: Triggered on every sync request

    Agent->>TM: Request token for API call
    TM->>Cache: Read encrypted binary data

    alt Cache missing or corrupt
        Cache-->>TM: Error / None
        TM-->>Agent: Re-seed required — ask user for new one-week token
        Note over Agent: Agent prompts user to visit portal and generate token
    else Cache valid
        Cache-->>TM: Ciphertext + Nonce
    end

    TM->>KC: keyring.get_password("InvestmentToolkit", "QuestradeMasterKey")
    KC-->>TM: AES-256 Master Key
    TM->>TM: AES-256-GCM Decrypt → current refresh_token

    TM->>QAuth: POST /oauth2/token?refresh_token=<current>
    alt Success (HTTP 200)
        QAuth-->>TM: New access_token + New refresh_token
        Note over TM, Cache: Atomic Swap (ADR 015)
        TM->>Cache: Write new refresh_token encrypted to .tmp
        TM->>Cache: os.replace(.tmp → .questrade_cache)
        TM-->>Agent: access_token ready
    else Failure (HTTP 400)
        QAuth-->>TM: Bad Request (token expired/already used)
        TM-->>Agent: Re-seed required — token expired
        Note over Agent: Agent prompts user to generate new one-week token
    end
